# Generated by hypr-rice — rendered on every `rice apply` to
# ~/.config/qt6ct/colors/rice.conf. qt6ct's static qt6ct.conf points
# `color_scheme_path` at this file, so swapping themes only rewrites this INI
# and re-launching a Qt6 app picks it up. See components/qt/template.md for
# the full design and the substitution map.
